orests, 5 dungeons, &amp; 7 small replayable dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 marked quest from the Adventurers Guild &amp; 5 untracked quests on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >several more secret areas that I wouldn't consider quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least a few hours of gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/6acdd0976fe10b377d707df1eed0780a.poster.avif?t=1749866704\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/6acdd0976fe10b377d707df1eed0780a.webm?t=1749866704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/6acdd0976fe10b377d707df1eed0780a.mp4?t=1749866704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/4cdf0fc68e361952811c442c540d5eb8.poster.avif?t=1749866704\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/4cdf0fc68e361952811c442c540d5eb8.webm?t=1749866704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/4cdf0fc68e361952811c442c540d5eb8.mp4?t=1749866704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/3b29dc96fa4ec396c2ea4f47e8306bb5.poster.avif?t=1749866704\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654130/extras/3b29dc96fa4ec396c2ea4f47e8